[en.IDEA_C23_STORM_CREATURES_PROTEST]
Storm Creatures Protest

[en.IDEA_C23_STORM_CREATURES_PROTEST_desc]
Due to a theft case involving a veteran Storm Creature, all Storm Creatures across the country have taken to the streets. However, the situation is still under control for now.

[zh.IDEA_C23_STORM_CREATURES_PROTEST]
风暴兽的抗议

[zh.IDEA_C23_STORM_CREATURES_PROTEST_desc]
因一场涉及风暴兽老兵的盗窃案，现在全国的风暴兽都开始走上了街头。不过目前事态还处于可控范围之内。
